Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.15,0:00:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Kikkun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.10,0:00:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnFredoka\b1\fs20\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord1.5\pos(107.2,69.333)}The Mass-Produced Organism, \NMamezou, datsun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.95,0:00:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello everyone, welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.51,0:00:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Kikkun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.59,0:00:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you as always for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.11,0:00:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, we're going to learn about Mamezou, \Na mass-produced organism.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.43,0:00:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamezous are highly cautious and keep a \Ncertain distance from anyone outside their group,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.17,0:00:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,but we managed to capture one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.23,0:00:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.05,0:00:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
