Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.95,0:00:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know this, mame.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.47,0:00:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,An unknown number?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.83,0:00:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous, mame.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.39,0:00:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,From an unknown digit, mame.
