Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.56,0:01:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnFredoka\b1\fs20\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord1.5\pos(199.2,19.2)} Slightly larger than A4 size
