Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.59,0:01:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Side-to-side jumps. Ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.91,0:01:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.43,0:01:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? They're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.06,0:01:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, stop, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.83,0:01:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tsuntsun.
